      "This guide looks at what the main research actually says, which kinds of work are most exposed, what is different about Nepal, and what workers, students and business owners can do now. It is written by a software team that builds and uses AI tools, so we have an interest in the topic; we have tried to stick to what the research says rather than to hype or fear.",
